  "notes": "Portal followed where the Rust impl diverged: with two replicates and only one d13co2 value, calcMean(na.rm) yields the lone value as d13C_DIC_avg and calcSd yields KEEP OLD (key omitted); the Rust dic_replicates omits both unless both replicates carry d13co2 (one_sided_d13c pins the portal behavior, matching the dic_replicates golden fixtures). The same na.rm averaging applies to DIC when one replicate's co2_dry is missing (null_co2_replicate_a). The wrapper also accepts null for fields the Rust request types as required f64 (co2_dry_ppm, sa_added_ml), computing whatever the portal functions can and omitting the rest. Constants used: h_co2_29815k, gas_const_r_mol, vial_volume, h3po4_added (request values override), lab_temp_avg_degC (fallback when lab_temp_c absent). No curves."
